-- Make the baseline's recorded privileges effective. The baseline lists each object's grants but
-- not the revokes, while new objects on a Supabase stack start with broad default grants. Reset
-- client and service roles on baseline objects to exactly the recorded grants, then re-apply the
-- later migrations' explicit grants and revokes in their original order.
